    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84952" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ̆-κλυστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>much-dashing, stormy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυκλύστῳ ἐνὶ πόντῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.354
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				6.204
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				189
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pancrat.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				1085.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>washed by many a wave,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυκλύστῳ ἐνὶ Κύπρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					199
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάραγγες Ὄσσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.597
				</span></i>
			.</div>
